iv 3600 = 2 \\text{ hours}\n\\]\n\nSince 7200 seconds exactly equals 2 hours, there are no additional minutes to add.\n\nNext, we add this duration to the current time of 2:30 p.m.:\n\n- Starting time: 2:30 p.m.\n- Adding 2 hours: \\(2 \\text{ p.m.} + 2 \\text{ hours} = 4 \\text{ p.m.}\\)\n\nThus, Bobbi and her family will arrive at their destination at:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{4:30 \\text{ p.m.}}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{4:30 \\text{ p.m.}}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
